  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用 KubeJS 建立自訂的 Create<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a>&nbsp;Ponder 場景。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請閱讀 GitHub 維基以查找範例，或加入我們的 Discord 尋求協助。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組是 PonderJS<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a> 的延續，適用於 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>1.18.2 及以上版本</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若您使用的是較舊版本，請查看原始專案<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[link]</a>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>鳴謝</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kotakotik22/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">kotakotik22</a>&nbsp;提供原始專案</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a>&nbsp;團隊提供 Ponder 系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>連結</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 維基</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Readme 頁面</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
